# Options for proxmox-node-exporter (read by its systemd unit).
# Run `python3 /opt/proxmox-node-exporter/proxmox-node-exporter.pyz --help`
# for the full list, then `systemctl restart proxmox-node-exporter`.
#
# Examples:
#   Listen on one address only:
#     --web.listen-address=10.0.0.5:9101
#   TLS and/or basic auth (see /etc/proxmox-node-exporter/web.ini.example):
#     --web.config-file=/etc/proxmox-node-exporter/web.ini
#   Turn collectors off, or slow one down:
#     --collectors.disable=containers,ups --collector.interval=smart=300
#
# This file is created on first install and never overwritten afterwards.
ARGS=""
